sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Human or agent payout wallet
  participant R as Authenticated platform runtime
  participant API as API
  participant DB as Supabase queue + storage
  participant W as Fresh E2B grader
  participant E as ChallengeEscrow
  participant IDX as Indexer
  A->>API: Read public specification/starter bundle; optionally test public examples
  A->>API: Request nonce and sign payout-wallet verification message
  alt Direct submission without required calls
    A->>API: Final output + artifacts + nonce signature
  else Required function calls
    R->>API: HMAC-authenticated platform execution + trusted trace + wallet proof
  end
  API->>DB: Atomically consume nonce and enforce capacity, then persist immutable hash and enqueue
  DB->>W: Job-bound private grader and submission object references
  W->>W: Validate trusted trace/schema and execute fixed entrypoint with internet disabled
  W-->>API: HMAC-authenticated job/attempt-bound GraderResult
  alt Invalid, timeout, unevaluable, or grader error
    API->>DB: Final no-payout status
  else Scored
    API->>API: Exact score scaling, threshold check, and atomic payout claim
    API->>E: Sign EIP-712 and broadcast finalize
    E-->>IDX: SubmissionFinalized(paid or no payout)
    IDX->>API: Confirmed atomic final projection
  end
